nal","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作張敬兒。"},{"start":36,"end":37,"surface":"女","id":"c-nanshi-019-chaozong:p006:u0036","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"張敬兒女，未名，與超宗子結婚。"},{"start":38,"end":39,"surface":"婦","id":"c-nanshi-019-chaozong:p006:u0038","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"上見張氏女。"},{"start":46,"end":48,"surface":"敬兒","id":"c-nanshi-019-chaozong:p006:m0046","person_id":"stv_g27_gl2","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作張敬兒。"},{"start":50,"end":52,"surface":"超宗","id":"c-nanshi-019-chaozong:p006:m0050","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_CDAABA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作超宗。"},{"start":56,"end":59,"surface":"李安人","id":"c-nanshi-019-chaozong:p006:m0056","person_id":"4xf_x1f_vsg","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作李安民。"},{"start":65,"end":67,"surface":"韓信","id":"c-nanshi-019-chaozong:p006:m0065","person_id":"ofc_8ei_jb7","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作韓信。"},{"start":71,"end":73,"surface":"彭越","id":"c-nanshi-019-chaozong:p006:m0071","person_id":"9qt_orl_5f2","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作彭越。"},{"start":80,"end":82,"surface":"安人","id":"c-nanshi-019-chaozong:p006:m0080","person_id":"4xf_x1f_vsg","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作李安民。"},{"start":89,"end":91,"surface":"超宗","id":"c-nanshi-019-chaozong:p006:m0089","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_CDAABA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作超宗。"},{"start":98,"end":100,"surface":"袁彖","id":"c-nanshi-019-chaozong:p006:m0098","person_id":"x6r_6az_6zn","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作袁彖。"},{"start":101,"end":103,"surface":"超宗","id":"c-nan